(7486534, 1191615, 124815, '<td valign="top">First image that appears for this challenge. A wonderful one  but it''s on the border of being a photograph. I imagine a little series of 5 maybe on the subject. What makes it a photo is the greenish hue. The only thing that I wish would be a bit of cropping on the top where the blob of light imagines a head. <br/>In any case, an very engaging image. 9</td>', 'First image that appears for this challenge. A wonderful one  but it''s on the border of being a photograph. I imagine a little series of 5 maybe on the subject. What makes it a photo is the greenish hue. The only thing that I wish would be a bit of cropping on the top where the blob of light imagines a head. In any case, an very engaging image. 9', '2016-12-09 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7486552, 1191344, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W. The amount of blur is perfect. Nice contrast, the dark hair and darkened eyes bring the head into focus right away giving you the true emotion of dizziness or vertigo. Great shot! Well done!</td>', 'Very nice B&W. The amount of blur is perfect. Nice contrast, the dark hair and darkened eyes bring the head into focus right away giving you the true emotion of dizziness or vertigo. Great shot! Well done!', '2016-12-09 01:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
