(7486920, 1191496, 115814, '<td valign="top">Sébastien - It''s definitely moody and I gave it a 8. For me, I get a sense of cold and damp, perhaps even eerie stillness. Not so "dizzy" though, although I do recall the completely disorienting sensation of snow blindness where fog and snow blend to completely deny any sense of direction. A bit more fog and this might bring a similar sensation. Regardless, it''s a great image and you handled the blending composite well.</td>', 'Sébastien - It''s definitely moody and I gave it a 8. For me, I get a sense of cold and damp, perhaps even eerie stillness. Not so "dizzy" though, although I do recall the completely disorienting sensation of snow blindness where fog and snow blend to completely deny any sense of direction. A bit more fog and this might bring a similar sensation. Regardless, it''s a great image and you handled the blending composite well.', '2016-12-12 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
